# NestJS Learning Roadmap

A collection of 10 hands-on mini-projects built while learning NestJS, progressing from fundamental concepts to advanced backend development.

## Projects

| No. | Project | Concepts |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Hello API | NestJS fundamentals, controllers and services |
| 2 | Student Service | Dependency injection and providers |
| 3 | Validation | DTOs and request validation |
| 4 | MongoDB | MongoDB and Mongoose integration |
| 5 | Blog API | REST APIs and CRUD operations |
| 6 | Blog Comments | Relationships and nested resources |
| 7 | Authentication | JWT, sessions and authentication |
| 8 | Authorization & Security | Guards, roles and security |
| 9 | Testing & Documentation | Unit testing, E2E testing and Swagger |
| 10 | Background Jobs | Redis, BullMQ, Nodemailer and scheduled notifications |

## Tech Stack

- NestJS
- TypeScript
- Node.js
- MongoDB and Mongoose
- Redis and BullMQ
- JWT authentication
- Vitest and Supertest
- Swagger
- Docker

## Repository Structure

Each mini-project is maintained in its own folder with independent dependencies and configuration.

## Purpose

This repository documents practical NestJS learning through progressively more advanced backend projects.